    },
    "opening": {
      "caption_gap_checked": true,
      "caption_samples": [
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 3.5295634920635,
          "text": "听见了吗？下雨的时候，"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 6.30961900000002,
          "text": "老城就是这个声儿。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 11.4584663333335,
          "text": "从前啊，夜市一开灯，"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 14.512469809524,
          "text": "谁家的窗户都舍不得关。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 20.8575062121213,
          "text": "后来，街拆了。我就一层一层，"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 23.6363623333331,
          "text": "把它刻在纸里。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 31.0414879999997,
          "text": "这张纸呀，最怕沾上墨水。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 38.2213519696967,
          "text": "一小滴，也能把一条街的模样，慢慢盖住。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 47.0073235555552,
          "text": "可灯一亮，你听，它们又热闹起来了。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 56.0166666666659,
          "text": "卖汽水的，修车的，"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 58.6075757575751,
          "text": "还有总不肯早早回家的小麻雀。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 68.2833333333317,
          "text": "要是哪天，你看见城里暗了一块，别怕。"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 76.2560063333302,
          "text": "把光照过去。记着，照走的是墨，留下的，"
        },
        {
          "matches": true,
          "media_seconds": 79.22179433333,
          "text": "是咱们的城。"
        }
      ],
